{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":138,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1916866,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":288152,"Name":"Lposos","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1481738697,"LastPoster":{"Id":288103,"Name":"beckerweddingfilms","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288103.jpg?_r=1480612609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1916866,"PostDate":1481738697,"PostContent":"Hi ladies, I am getting married in April 2018. But I am having trouble on the resort to use. So f...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lnr0428@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.162.43.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1481738364,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Lposos","Id":288152,"Name":"Lposos","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.162.43.162","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80863,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"febb2b948c3ce5b2392daded5c9d11ad","RawContent":"Hi ladies,\n\n\nI am getting married in April 2018. But I am having trouble on the resort to use. So far I&#039;ve narrowed down my choices to azul five, generation riviera maya, el dorado casita, moon palace and secret Maroma beach. Have any booked their wedding at any of these resorts? I love the karisma resorts but I do not see that they offer promotions. For instance palace resort offers free events, or upgrades for booking a certain amount of rooms. If anyone has another advice on other resort hotels I should look at please let me know. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1916866,"PostDate":1481738697,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies,<br><br>\nI am getting married in April 2018. But I am having trouble on the resort to use. So far I've narrowed down my choices to azul five, generation riviera maya, el dorado casita, moon palace and secret Maroma beach. Have any booked their wedding at any of these resorts? I love the karisma resorts but I do not see that they offer promotions. For instance palace resort offers free events, or upgrades for booking a certain amount of rooms. If anyone has another advice on other resort hotels I should look at please let me know. <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lnr0428@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.162.43.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1481738364,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Lposos","Id":288152,"Name":"Lposos","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80863,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d66b84a7e60be737ca988b4b1989c288","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#254061;\"&gt;Hello Beautiful Ladies,&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(37,64,97);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#254061;\"&gt;We would love to partake in such a memorable event in your lives \u2013 In reality, there is no other resort or location in Puerto Vallarta &amp;amp; Mexico overall. Adventure Weddings offers a private beach area, seclusion and breath taking backdrop at Las Caletas Beach Hideaway. Please find the following link video of the special moment that awaits you:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#254061;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/drive.google.com\/open?id=0B7JVVsetSElnZEFhT2kwRXNDV3M&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#254061;\"&gt;https:\/\/drive.google.com\/open?id=0B7JVVsetSElnZEFhT2kwRXNDV3M&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Email us: info@adventureweddingsvallarta.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Call us: 1-866-822-2697&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/em&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916867,"PostDate":1481741583,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#254061\">Hello Beautiful Ladies,\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(37,64,97)\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#254061\">We would love to partake in such a memorable event in your lives \u2013 In reality, there is no other resort or location in Puerto Vallarta & Mexico overall. Adventure Weddings offers a private beach area, seclusion and breath taking backdrop at Las Caletas Beach Hideaway. Please find the following link video of the special moment that awaits you:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#254061\"><a href='https:\/\/drive.google.com\/open?id=0B7JVVsetSElnZEFhT2kwRXNDV3M' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#254061\">https:\/\/drive.google.com\/open?id=0B7JVVsetSElnZEFhT2kwRXNDV3M<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><em><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Email us: info@adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/div>\n<div><em><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Call us: 1-866-822-2697<\/span><\/span><\/em><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343058803,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpg?_r=1475871220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.141.149","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80863,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ef8d796522daf0c79d1435bf27be5f8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Lposos\"] I am also getting married April 2018! I have a wedding planner that I&#039;m working with trying to narrow down the resorts and happy with the progress so far. I have some of the same resorts on my list including Azul Fives and Moon Palace. I have heard mixed reviews about Azul Fives, lots of brides saying it&#039;s fabulous but also saw some complaints about outside vendor fees. I was also looking at Dreams Tulum and Dreams Riviera Cancun. I am not the type to make decisions quickly so just doing my research. Hope you enjoy your planning!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916893,"PostDate":1482287916,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"288152\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/288152-lposos\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lposos<\/span><\/a> I am also getting married April 2018! I have a wedding planner that I'm working with trying to narrow down the resorts and happy with the progress so far. I have some of the same resorts on my list including Azul Fives and Moon Palace. I have heard mixed reviews about Azul Fives, lots of brides saying it's fabulous but also saw some complaints about outside vendor fees. I was also looking at Dreams Tulum and Dreams Riviera Cancun. I am not the type to make decisions quickly so just doing my research. Hope you enjoy your planning!\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laurariello78@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.136.141.149","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1482283287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288179.jpg?_r=1482283685","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lauraspug","Id":288179,"Name":"Lauraspug","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"86.180.88.27","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80863,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e23663e78e511ced9e52861a135cc3d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Girls!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What an exciting time for you both! Being a wedding videographer here in Riviera Maya I visit MANY of the resorts all across the region and honestly, you really are spoilt for choice there are so many beautiful locations and resorts. What I would suggest first is to narrow down what area you would like the resort to be in - Cancun, Puerto Morelos, Playa Del Carmen or Tulum...then once you have decided this you can choose from the hotels and resorts within that region, but I must warn you, it will be difficult as there are just too many to choose from :P&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you want to check out some particular locations, I do have examples of my work on my website and here you will see some of the locations here in Riviera Maya such as Azul Fives, Barcelo, Sandos ecttt -&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bbweddingfilms.com\/portfolio&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bbweddingfilms.com\/portfolio&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope this helps :) And good luck!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916894,"PostDate":1482349474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Girls!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What an exciting time for you both! Being a wedding videographer here in Riviera Maya I visit MANY of the resorts all across the region and honestly, you really are spoilt for choice there are so many beautiful locations and resorts. What I would suggest first is to narrow down what area you would like the resort to be in - Cancun, Puerto Morelos, Playa Del Carmen or Tulum...then once you have decided this you can choose from the hotels and resorts within that region, but I must warn you, it will be difficult as there are just too many to choose from <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you want to check out some particular locations, I do have examples of my work on my website and here you will see some of the locations here in Riviera Maya such as Azul Fives, Barcelo, Sandos ecttt -\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bbweddingfilms.com\/portfolio' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bbwedding...s.com\/portfolio<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope this helps <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> And good luck!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hannalarsson4@msn.com","IpAddress":"177.237.75.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1480612458,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-288103.jpg?_r=1480612609","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beckerweddingfilms","Id":288103,"Name":"beckerweddingfilms","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80863","Title":"Wedding Venue 2018","LastPostDate":1482349474},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
