09700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpg?_r=1452788764","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":296,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TATrisha","Id":207201,"Name":"TATrisha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4828,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7de6e19f4fab520cecad3fa89554f6d7","RawContent":"Hello Amy!\n \n &lt;i&gt;The $2800 package at Dreams includes a trio for an hour.&lt;\/i&gt;\n \n My package is 2400$ and the music trio is 45 minutes... \n \n I guess they don&#039;t send the same 3 packages to everyone ! \n \n Annie","Attachments":[],"Id":79585,"PostDate":1184971406,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello Amy!<br \/> <br \/> <i>The $2800 package at Dreams includes a trio for an hour.<\/i><br \/> <br \/> My package is 2400$ and the music trio is 45 minutes... <br \/> <br \/> I guess they don't send the same 3 packages to everyone ! <br \/> <br \/> Annie\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roy-annie@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"173.176.10.21","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1184528486,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207537.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DreamsTulumBride","Id":207537,"Name":"DreamsTulumBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4828,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43367c0ea181c520d7b84c0ead226a8e","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Tlseege&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Hmmm... so the $330 that my resort charges is pretty good then huh?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;You have a resort already, but no ring. Tell that man of yours that we girls are waiting to see your bling. He doesn&#039;t want us hunting him down, now does he!","Attachments":[],"Id":79586,"PostDate":1184971441,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Tlseege<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Hmmm... so the $330 that my resort charges is pretty good then huh?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>You have a resort already, but no ring. Tell that man of yours that we girls are waiting to see your bling. He doesn't want us hunting him down, now does he!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dragonfly4hope13@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1176506040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207341.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dragonfly","Id":207341,"Name":"dragonfly","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":4828,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea7cb0ae7d17a3484efb38f9746831c8","RawContent":"OK... let me rephrase that... the resort that we are thinking about :) \n Yeah, we pretty much have everything at least talked about... but no bling. Boys!","Attachments":[],"Id":79589,"PostDate":1184971537,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                OK... let me rephrase that... the resort that we are thinking about <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)