{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.205.66.18","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80012,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6905224b48556e4205b120b1fbe2b021","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Just wondering if there are any other brides trying to plan their wedding at the Grand Palladium. Can&#039;t decide between the Jamaica or Mayan resort! Thoughts? Experiences?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912217,"PostDate":1459008869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Just wondering if there are any other brides trying to plan their wedding at the Grand Palladium. Can't decide between the Jamaica or Mayan resort! Thoughts? Experiences?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shira_mei@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"104.205.66.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436987380,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Shira2015","Id":283977,"Name":"Shira2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.128.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80012,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1459014314,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1ed26faa5972bf5fe00896e6a8026ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Shira2015 and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! You&#039;ll find lots of helpful info, advice, suggestions + support from everyone on these boards, so well done on getting off to such a great start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re based in Mexico, so of course would recommend our incomparable Riviera Maya!!! To show you what we&#039;re talking about, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured at our Grand Palladium weddings here....ENJOY!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Grand-Palladium-Wedding-UK-with-Love\/k7mfu\/56d852280cf25a66a5365043&#039;&gt;Grand Palladium Kantenah Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_06658b718bc749e79076b3be73dbdc54.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_06658b718bc749e79076b3be73dbdc54.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_06658b718bc749e79076b3be73dbdc54.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_437a7d37d73d44388613af3900e5a707.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_437a7d37d73d44388613af3900e5a707.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_437a7d37d73d44388613af3900e5a707.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3a49f041b48241e28c3e6f1d9fcdb907.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3a49f041b48241e28c3e6f1d9fcdb907.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3a49f041b48241e28c3e6f1d9fcdb907.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and that your plans turn out just the way YOU envision!!! cheers, team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912219,"PostDate":1459014242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Shira2015 and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! You'll find lots of helpful info, advice, suggestions + support from everyone on these boards, so well done on getting off to such a great start already <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're based in Mexico, so of course would recommend our incomparable Riviera Maya!!! To show you what we're talking about, here are some magical wedding moments that matter we've captured at our Grand Palladium weddings here....ENJOY!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!Grand-Palladium-Wedding-UK-with-Love\/k7mfu\/56d852280cf25a66a5365043' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Palladium Kantenah Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_06658b718bc749e79076b3be73dbdc54.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_06658b718bc749e79076b3be73dbdc54.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_06658b718bc749e79076b3be73dbdc54.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_437a7d37d73d44388613af3900e5a707.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_437a7d37d73d44388613af3900e5a707.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_437a7d37d73d44388613af3900e5a707.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3a49f041b48241e28c3e6f1d9fcdb907.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3a49f041b48241e28c3e6f1d9fcdb907.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3a49f041b48241e28c3e6f1d9fcdb907.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and that your plans turn out just the way YOU envision!!! cheers, team MTM <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
