ca, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">with any questions as I am one of the TA's for BDW. \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><b>Preety Jaswal - Canadian Wedding Specialist<\/b><\/p>\n<div style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG' title=\"External link\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>?<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' title=\"\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/div>\n","Email":"preety@travelbyplatinum.com","IpAddress":"69.50.165.200","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1448917439,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285479.jpg?_r=1450836897","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TAPreety","Id":285479,"Name":"TAPreety","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.214.3.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79881,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"331e8650959fd73e23279209e16571ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great idea for the wedding arch and I have also chosen blue as the main color for our wedding decor. :D&lt;