{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.73.199.69","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3191dba7d443dc2077f14e2e09d0e659","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hi ladies!&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I just got back from doing site visits in Cancun over New Years and my fiance and I fell in LOVE with the Hyatt Ziva Cancun. I&#039;d love to hear more from other ladies who are getting married there so we can share ideas, hear the pros\/cons, and all have the best weddings possible!&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;We&#039;ll likely be having around 130-140 guests. We&#039;re doing the rehearsal &amp;amp; rehearsal dinner on the beach. The wedding ceremony will be in the sky gazebo, cocktail hour on the Punta Vista Terrace, and reception in the ballroom.&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Would love to chat more with others booking their wedding here too!&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Best,&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Gwen&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909116,"PostDate":1452189757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hi ladies!<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I just got back from doing site visits in Cancun over New Years and my fiance and I fell in LOVE with the Hyatt Ziva Cancun. I'd love to hear more from other ladies who are getting married there so we can share ideas, hear the pros\/cons, and all have the best weddings possible!<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">We'll likely be having around 130-140 guests. We're doing the rehearsal & rehearsal dinner on the beach. The wedding ceremony will be in the sky gazebo, cocktail hour on the Punta Vista Terrace, and reception in the ballroom.<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Would love to chat more with others booking their wedding here too!<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Best,<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Gwen\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gwendolyn.brink@gmail.com","IpAddress":"63.73.199.69","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1450121147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285590.png?_r=1452183958","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":176,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GwendolynB","Id":285590,"Name":"GwendolynB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e927cbfe82857df490d99a4dfb4c27af","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@GwendolynB&amp;nbsp; Congrats on your upcoming wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you tried doing a search up top for the resort name to see what threads you get? The Hyatt Ziva is quite new but I seem to remember having seen a couple of posts in the past regarding this resort.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909130,"PostDate":1452215484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@GwendolynB\u00a0 Congrats on your upcoming wedding!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you tried doing a search up top for the resort name to see what threads you get? The Hyatt Ziva is quite new but I seem to remember having seen a couple of posts in the past regarding this resort.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;484\/st\/20111020\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6168\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.209.228.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1452394306,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d14a855f9b7c607e0c3fc6ebf371556","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285590-gwendolynb\/&#039; title=\"\"&gt;GwendolynB&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yay another Hyatt bride! I&#039;m getting married there in April. Soon much to do. Do you have photos? I won&#039;t get to do a site visit. I have a few that an agent posted on FB. I am doing all of my events at the sky gazebo. Did it seem like enough space? I&#039;ll have about 50 people. I have kids coming and my WP said that Punta Vista is adults only. Did they tell you that? My WP is Elsa but I want to request a new one. She takes too long to get back with me. Who&#039;s yours?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I had started a page of info looking for people a while back. But this a better place for sharing I guess.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79603-playa-resorts-cancun-hyatt-ziva-zilara-gran-caribe\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79603-playa-resorts-cancun-hyatt-ziva-zilara-gran-caribe\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909222,"PostDate":1452394244,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285590-gwendolynb\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>GwendolynB<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>Yay another Hyatt bride! I'm getting married there in April. Soon much to do. Do you have photos? I won't get to do a site visit. I have a few that an agent posted on FB. I am doing all of my events at the sky gazebo. Did it seem like enough space? I'll have about 50 people. I have kids coming and my WP said that Punta Vista is adults only. Did they tell you that? My WP is Elsa but I want to request a new one. She takes too long to get back with me. Who's yours?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had started a page of info looking for people a while back. But this a better place for sharing I guess.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79603-playa-resorts-cancun-hyatt-ziva-zilara-gran-caribe\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...ra-gran-caribe\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Amaqt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.169.122.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352510505,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissAmber26","Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.209.228.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ba9216640a40f993796de62446d35e9","RawContent":"OK so I lied. I just looked at my info again and my cocktail and reception are at Punta Vista terrace too. But I think thats the one thats connected to the sky gazebo area. There was another terrace I wanted that she said was in the adults only area.\n\n\n[quote name=\"MissAmber26\" post=\"1909222\" timestamp=\"1452394244\"]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285590-gwendolynb\/\"]GwendolynB[\/url]\nYay another Hyatt bride! I&#039;m getting married there in April. Soon much to do. Do you have photos? I won&#039;t get to do a site visit. I have a few that an agent posted on FB. I am doing all of my events at the sky gazebo. Did it seem like enough space? I&#039;ll have about 50 people. I have kids coming and my WP said that Punta Vista is adults only. Did they tell you that? My WP is Elsa but I want to request a new one. She takes too long to get back with me. Who&#039;s yours?\n\nI had started a page of info looking for people a while back. But this a better place for sharing I guess.\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79603-playa-resorts-cancun-hyatt-ziva-zilara-gran-caribe\/\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79603-playa-resorts-cancun-hyatt-ziva-zilara-gran-caribe\/[\/url][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1909223,"PostDate":1452397498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>OK so I lied. I just looked at my info again and my cocktail and reception are at Punta Vista terrace too. But I think thats the one thats connected to the sky gazebo area. There was another terrace I wanted that she said was in the adults only area.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MissAmber26, on 09 January 2016 - 06:50 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285590-gwendolynb\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>GwendolynB<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Yay another Hyatt bride! I'm getting married there in April. Soon much to do. Do you have photos? I won't get to do a site visit. I have a few that an agent posted on FB. I am doing all of my events at the sky gazebo. Did it seem like enough space? I'll have about 50 people. I have kids coming and my WP said that Punta Vista is adults only. Did they tell you that? My WP is Elsa but I want to request a new one. She takes too long to get back with me. Who's yours?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had started a page of info looking for people a while back. But this a better place for sharing I guess.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79603-playa-resorts-cancun-hyatt-ziva-zilara-gran-caribe\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...ra-gran-caribe\/<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Amaqt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.169.122.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352510505,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissAmber26","Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab45a28ac5880b789d9eb8bd240c6a64","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies! I thinking of changing my location to the Hyatt Ziva. Looks beautiful and everything I&#039;d like esepcially the beach! I&#039;m originally booked at Azul Sensatori and NOT happy about the beach and seaweed. I can&#039;t seem to over look it! How are their group rates?? How are the wedding packages looking?? I need to move my wedding here for Sept!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jackie&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909786,"PostDate":1453323132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies! I thinking of changing my location to the Hyatt Ziva. Looks beautiful and everything I'd like esepcially the beach! I'm originally booked at Azul Sensatori and NOT happy about the beach and seaweed. I can't seem to over look it! How are their group rates?? How are the wedding packages looking?? I need to move my wedding here for Sept!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Jackie<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackiec0176@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445626147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285167.jpg?_r=1480605976","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"JRodz","Id":285167,"Name":"JRodz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.218.16.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1453330740,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3fb3b318257f357470d15079dd87d7b3","RawContent":"The Hyatt prices are about the same as Hyatt.com. They&#039;ll just include airport transfers. Here is some info attached.\n\n\nDecor- Gama Grupo\n\nPhoto\/ Video- PhotoPro\n\nDJ- Encore\n\nSites- Sky gazebo\/ terrace. Adults only terrace. Ballroom. Beach. Cliffside beach gazebo","Attachments":[{"Id":34853,"Name":"RENDER GAZEBOHyatt cancun.jpg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-262240-0-94899600-1453330186.jpg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-262240-0-94899600-1453330186_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":556},{"Id":34854,"Name":"image.jpeg","Url":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-262240-0-86755000-1453330735.jpeg","ScaledUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2016\/post-262240-0-86755000-1453330735_thumb.jpeg","Width":768,"Height":768}],"Id":1909798,"PostDate":1453330085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The Hyatt prices are about the same as Hyatt.com. They'll just include airport transfers. Here is some info attached.<br><br>\nDecor- Gama Grupo<br>\nPhoto\/ Video- PhotoPro<br>\nDJ- Encore<br>\nSites- Sky gazebo\/ terrace. Adults only terrace. Ballroom. Beach. Cliffside beach gazebo\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Amaqt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.169.122.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352510505,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissAmber26","Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.148.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e82faa48064a165e384a067397a36fa","RawContent":"Looks amazing !! Thank you for sharing! Waiting to hear back from my terrible wedding specialist to see what our options are to cancel at other resort. Need to fire her !!","Attachments":[],"Id":1909835,"PostDate":1453392672,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Looks amazing !! Thank you for sharing! Waiting to hear back from my terrible wedding specialist to see what our options are to cancel at other resort. Need to fire her !!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackiec0176@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445626147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285167.jpg?_r=1480605976","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"JRodz","Id":285167,"Name":"JRodz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.194.194.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3361823faeaf8fa19672827b4b9e9d29","RawContent":"Hi &amp;amp; Congratulations! Just started looking into this resort, and it is my new #1 choice!\n\n\nSent from my SM-G900V using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1909908,"PostDate":1453513504,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi & Congratulations! Just started looking into this resort, and it is my new #1 choice!<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900V using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebeccarpeck@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.194.211.78","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1447422612,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rebeccarpeck","Id":285328,"Name":"rebeccarpeck","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.21.204.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a0fcd040ca8055120bec74e0f8a15fab","RawContent":"[quote name=\"GwendolynB\" post=\"1909116\" timestamp=\"1452189757\"]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Hi ladies![\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]I just got back from doing site visits in Cancun over New Years and my fiance and I fell in LOVE with the Hyatt Ziva Cancun. I&#039;d love to hear more from other ladies who are getting married there so we can share ideas, hear the pros\/cons, and all have the best weddings possible![\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]We&#039;ll likely be having around 130-140 guests. We&#039;re doing the rehearsal &amp;amp; rehearsal dinner on the beach. The wedding ceremony will be in the sky gazebo, cocktail hour on the Punta Vista Terrace, and reception in the ballroom.[\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Would love to chat more with others booking their wedding here too![\/font][\/color]\n\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Best,[\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Gwen [\/font][\/color][\/quote]Hi Gwen, \n\nDo you have any pictures to share from your visit??\n\nJackie","Attachments":[],"Id":1909987,"PostDate":1453688550,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>GwendolynB, on 07 January 2016 - 10:02 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hi ladies!<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I just got back from doing site visits in Cancun over New Years and my fiance and I fell in LOVE with the Hyatt Ziva Cancun. I'd love to hear more from other ladies who are getting married there so we can share ideas, hear the pros\/cons, and all have the best weddings possible!<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">We'll likely be having around 130-140 guests. We're doing the rehearsal & rehearsal dinner on the beach. The wedding ceremony will be in the sky gazebo, cocktail hour on the Punta Vista Terrace, and reception in the ballroom.<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Would love to chat more with others booking their wedding here too!<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Best,<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Gwen\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Gwen,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Do you have any pictures to share from your visit??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Jackie<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackiec0176@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445626147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285167.jpg?_r=1480605976","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"JRodz","Id":285167,"Name":"JRodz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.189.124.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79846,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86176f9965541314ceb366011c08eade","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MissAmber26\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats and Thanks so much for the pictures and PDFs. I am in the process of moving my wedding from the Hyatt Zilara to the Ziva! Just waiting back to see if I have to change the date.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have visited all the sites, but it was 2 years ago when Ziva was the Dreams. Now that Hyatt took over the few items I wasn&#039;t fond of should be gone! If you have any other pictures or tips please share. My wedding will be in October of 2016.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910134,"PostDate":1453932783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"262240\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/262240-missamber26\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MissAmber26<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats and Thanks so much for the pictures and PDFs. I am in the process of moving my wedding from the Hyatt Zilara to the Ziva! Just waiting back to see if I have to change the date.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have visited all the sites, but it was 2 years ago when Ziva was the Dreams. Now that Hyatt took over the few items I wasn't fond of should be gone! If you have any other pictures or tips please share. My wedding will be in October of 2016.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"colleeneoconnell@gmail.com","IpAddress":"72.189.124.207","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1379553192,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273589.jpg?_r=1453933065","PhotoWidth":165,"PhotoHeight":190,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Spoiledtator","Id":273589,"Name":"Spoiledtator","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":167,"TotalPages":17,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":160},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
