:"custom"},"FormattedName":"TATrisha","Id":207201,"Name":"TATrisha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3a09cb8876658f8cd1788cd818b9252","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;MMM CAKE&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cake options&amp;nbsp;are round, 3 tiered round, and heart shaped. These are the cakes the come with the packages and are said to only feed 10 people.&amp;nbsp; You can skip dessert with your included dinner reception and upgrade your cake for free.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We chose the tres leche (3 milk cake) and it was really good. Our family and friends enjoyed it too. It was moist and creamy and tasted like it was fresh out the oven. The only thing we didn&#039;t like was the fondant, but it wouldn&#039;t be a wedding cake if it didn&#039;t have that on top. Just peel it away and eat the good stuff. :-)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v1\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532690\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v2\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532692\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v3\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532694\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v4\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532696\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v5\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532698\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v6\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532701\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v8\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532703\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v9\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532705\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v10\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532714\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v11\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532716\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v12\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532718\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514326,"PostDate":1314972895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <strong>MMM CAKE<\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Cake options\u00a0are round, 3 tiered round, and heart shaped. These are the cakes the come with the packages and are said to only feed 10 people.\u00a0 You can skip dessert with your included dinner reception and upgrade your cake for free.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We chose the tres leche (3 milk cake) and it was really good. Our family and friends enjoyed it too. It was moist and creamy and tasted like it was fresh out the oven. The only thing we didn't like was the fondant, but it wouldn't be a wedding cake if it didn't have that on top. Just peel it away and eat the good stuff. :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v1\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532690\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v2\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532692\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v3\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532694\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v4\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532696\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v5\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532698\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v6\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532701\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v8\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532703\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v9\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532705\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v10\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532714\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v11\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532716\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Gran Bahia Riviera Maya Wedding Cake Options v12\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/532718\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~Trisha~<\/p>\n<p>Destination Wedding Photographer & Travel Agent<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com\">www.faberphotography.com<\/a>\u00a0-\u00a0My latest destination wedding photos can be found\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/\">HERE<\/a><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Disney Specialist\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a  class=\"bbc_url\" hre