; &lt;p&gt; Dress steaming is available - $15-25&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; $250 to rent the equipment to play a slideshow&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"225743000042409260_De651eVp_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834872\/width\/554\/height\/368\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"225743000042409261_F2cWEoJK_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834870\/width\/554\/height\/367\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"225743000042409266_nbYENs3X_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834868\/width\/426\/height\/640\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514327,"PostDate":1314972900,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <u><strong>RANDOM DETAILS<\/strong><\/u><\/p> <p> Chair covers & white sashes are included for the ceremony<\/p> <p> Maracas are for sale at the Hacienda for $1-2 each<\/p> <p> Vegetarian meals are available at no extra charge<\/p> <p> Dress steaming is available - $15-25<\/p> <p> $250 to rent the equipment to play a slideshow<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"225743000042409260_De651eVp_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834872\/width\/554\/height\/368\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"225743000042409261_F2cWEoJK_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834870\/width\/554\/height\/367\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"225743000042409266_nbYENs3X_c.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/834868\/width\/426\/height\/640\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>~Trisha~<\/p>\n<p>Destination Wedding Photographer & Travel Agent<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com\">www.faberphotography.com<\/a>\u00a0-\u00a0My latest destination wedding photos can be found\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/\">HERE<\/a><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Disney Specialist\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">\u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/\" title=\"\"><strong>Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\">\u00a0<br><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\">Looking for a travel agent that KNOWS DISNEY?<\/a><\/span><\/strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">\u00a0 We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/\" title=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 | \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0| \u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator |\u00a0<strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/\" title=\"\">Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/a>\u00a0|\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 | \u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><br><span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17612\/sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17612_13451.png\"><\/span><span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0<span><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010\" title=\"\">Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(178,34,34);\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com\" title=\"External link\">ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"trisha@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1172009700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpg?_r=1452788764","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":296,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TATrisha","Id":207201,"Name":"TATrisha","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1394482436,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42a404c6925ac96edf4041a35f87aaf3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLOWERS&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is the flower document.&amp;nbsp; I appoligize that it has to be in attachment form, but it&#039;s too large to place otherwise.&amp;nbsp; PLEASE remember it is \"illegal\" on this forum to ask for people to email you things.&amp;nbsp; You can get banned for this.&amp;nbsp; Please just contribute to different threads to get above the 150 post mark and then download it legally or purchase the upgrade to download immediately.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These are not the ONLY flowers you can get.&amp;nbsp; As long as you provide a picture of what you want and it incorporates the types of flowers you see in these brochures, it should be included.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can email your coordinator a picture of the flowers you want and they should be able to recreate them.&amp;nbsp; If they have exotic flowers in them such as orchids then it&#039;ll cost you extra.&amp;nbsp; Roses\/Lilies\/etc are included in your wedding package price.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can bring your own flower ribbon &amp;amp; pins and they will use that.&amp;nbsp; Otherwise white is included.&amp;nbsp; You can also request to not have the huge white bow that is pictured in most of the images in the catalog.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;EXTRA FLOWERS&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;-&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;Prices depend on type of flowers and size. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$36 Bridesmaids bouquets &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$15 Boutonniere &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$25 Bracelet of flowers &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$18 Corsage &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$6&amp;nbsp; Lilies or gerbers for the hair &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$40 Centerpieces &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$10 Bag of petals for decoration of tables or aisle&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$25 Flowers for the cake &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:40px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$6   Flower for decoration of the chairs&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are some posts about flowers:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/980#post_605852&#039;&gt;Post #983&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/980#post_606839&#039;&gt;Post #986&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1050#post_632494&#039;&gt;Post #1057&lt;\/a&gt; - Flower Brochures again&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1670#post_913439&#039;&gt;Post #1675&lt;\/a&gt; - Flower price list 2009&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1880#post_994474&#039;&gt;Post #1884&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1890#post_998437&#039;&gt;Post #1891&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2810#post_1273589&#039;&gt;Post #2819 &lt;\/a&gt;- Wrist Corsages&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3090#post_1343388&#039;&gt;Post #3092&lt;\/a&gt; - Budget breakdown &amp;amp; pictures&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3090#post_1343798&#039;&gt;Post #3094&lt;\/a&gt; - Budget breakdown &amp;amp; pictures&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4560#post_1665128&#039;&gt;Post #4566&lt;\/a&gt; - My bridal flowers (Included)&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Bridesmaid flowers ($38 each)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514328,"PostDate":1314972906,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong>FLOWERS<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is the flower document.\u00a0 I appoligize that it has to be in attachment form, but it's too large to place otherwise.\u00a0 PLEASE remember it is \"illegal\" on this forum to ask for people to email you things.\u00a0 You can get banned for this.\u00a0 Please just contribute to different threads to get above the 150 post mark and then download it legally or purchase the upgrade to download immediately.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26906\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/doc.gif\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26906\" title=\"\"><strong>Gran Bahia Flowers 1.doc<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>3.82MB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">87 <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26907\" title=\"\"><img src=\"https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/public\/style_extra\/mime_types\/doc.gif\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpapp=core&amp;module=attach&amp;section=attach&amp;attach_id=26907\" title=\"\"><strong>Gran Bahia Flowers 2.doc<\/strong><\/a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span class='desc'><strong>1.49MB<\/strong><\/span>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"desc lighter\">54 <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These are not the ONLY flowers you can get.\u00a0 As long as you provide a picture of what you want and it incorporates the types of flowers you see in these brochures, it should be included.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can email your coordinator a picture of the flowers you want and they should be able to recreate them.\u00a0 If they have exotic flowers in them such as orchids then it'll cost you extra.\u00a0 Roses\/Lilies\/etc are included in your wedding package price.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can bring your own flower ribbon & pins and they will use that.\u00a0 Otherwise white is included.\u00a0 You can also request to not have the huge white bow that is pictured in most of the images in the catalog.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><strong><u><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">EXTRA FLOWERS<\/span><\/span><\/u><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\"> <\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">-<strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\"> <\/span><\/span><\/strong>Prices depend on type of flowers and size. <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$36 Bridesmaids bouquets <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$15 Boutonniere <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$25 Bracelet of flowers <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$18 Corsage <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$6\u00a0 Lilies or gerbers for the hair <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$40 Centerpieces <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$10 Bag of petals for decoration of tables or aisle<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$25 Flowers for the cake <\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:40px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$6\u00a0\u00a0 Flower for decoration of the chairs<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are some posts about flowers:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/980#post_605852' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #983<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/980#post_606839' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #986<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1050#post_632494' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1057<\/a> - Flower Brochures again<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1670#post_913439' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1675<\/a> - Flower price list 2009<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1880#post_994474' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1884<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1890#post_998437' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1891<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2810#post_1273589' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #2819 <\/a>- Wrist Corsages<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3090#post_1343388' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #3092<\/a> - Budget breakdown & pictures<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3090#post_1343798' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #3094<\/a> - Budget breakdown & pictures<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationweddin