hoto-276748.jpg?_r=1445822927","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"diadiamond","Id":276748,"Name":"diadiamond","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79202,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9174ade7093a680582ef74ec7f8d07d9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"diadiamond\"] I agree with @[member=\"perianjay\"] I can&#039;t see any reason why you can&#039;t join in. As she said, the more the merrier! I think we&#039;re still finalizing the location. @[member=\"snswedding2016\"] mentioned some but not sure everyone yet has come back with a \"yes\". I can see Young &amp;amp; Front being a good central for everyone I think. Just have to see how the responses come along.... there are a couple of ladies that haven&#039;t been here much lately, and that&#039;s always an issue with people being on summer vacation. Hard to do the total roundup.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just keep watching the forum and see where we end up.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901641,"PostDate":1438351434,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276748\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276748-diadiamond\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">diadiamond<\/span><\/a> I agree with @perianjay I can't see any reason why you can't join in. As she said, the more the merrier! I think we're still finalizing the location. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281055\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281055-snswedding2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">snswedding2016<\/span><\/a> mentioned some but not sure everyone yet has come back with a \"yes\". I can see Young & Front being a good central for everyone I think. Just have to see how the responses come along.... there are a couple of ladies that haven't been here much lately, and that's always an issue with people being on summer vacation. Hard to do the total roundup.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just keep watching the forum and see where we end up.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;484\/st\/20111020\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6168\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth"