ing home from work\/it being rush hour.. i&#039;ll just take public transit down. Union is right there so it works perfect.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902527,"PostDate":1439566010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> haha. I'm taking public transit (so that I don't have to worry about having a drink or two). I usually drive downtown, but I figured with it being a Friday and most people are still driving home from work\/it being rush hour.. i'll just take public transit down. Union is right there so it works perfect.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","